n has touched me and I have not been unchaste?\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"19:21","t":"He said, \"Thus [it will be]; your Lord says, 'It is easy for Me, and We will make him a sign to the people and a mercy from Us. And it is a matter [already] decreed.'\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"19:22","t":"So she conceived him, and she withdrew with him to a remote place.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":22,"sd":null},{"k":"19:23","t":"And the pains of childbirth drove her to the trunk of a palm tree. She said, \"Oh, I wish I had died before this and was in oblivion, forgotten.\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":23,"sd":null},{"k":"19:24","t":"But he called her from below her, \"Do not grieve; your Lord has provided beneath you a stream.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":24,"sd":null},{"k":"19:25","t":"And shake toward you the trunk of the palm tree; it will drop upon you ripe, fresh dates.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":25,"sd":null}],"juz":16,"hizb":31,"surahs":[19],"sajdah":false}